\newlabel{fig:gallery_cw}{{2}{3}{Representative clockwise (CW) spiral galaxies from the catalog, ordered by decreasing classification confidence (left to right, top to bottom). Each cutout is $224 \times 224$~pixels ($\sim \!59'' \times 59''$) in $grz$ composite from DESI Legacy DR8. All examples shown have equivariant confidence $\pcw ^{\rm eq} > 0.95$}{figure.2}{}}
