\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Representative counter-clockwise (CCW) spiral galaxies, presented identically to Fig.~\ref {fig:gallery_cw}. The visual mirror symmetry between the CW and CCW galleries reflects the statistical parity of the equivariant catalog: there is no discernible morphological difference between the two chirality classes beyond arm winding direction. }}{4}{figure.3}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:gallery_ccw}{{3}{4}{Representative counter-clockwise (CCW) spiral galaxies, presented identically to Fig.~\ref {fig:gallery_cw}. The visual mirror symmetry between the CW and CCW galleries reflects the statistical parity of the equivariant catalog: there is no discernible morphological difference between the two chirality classes beyond arm winding direction}{figure.3}{}}
